 "notes": [
  "From Q2-18 a \"Corporate\" revenue line (Kensho) is printed in the segment table and Corporate Unallocated is shown net of it. seg_other.corp = Corporate Unallocated operating loss as printed (net of corporate revenue, positive cost); corp_rev = Corporate revenue; corp_exp = Corporate Unallocated expense. check_rec \"sum seg rev + elim = rev\" therefore differs by corp_rev (not a transcription error): segments + elim + corp_rev = total revenue.",
