  "Provisional U.S. tax reform charge reduced by $8m (benefit) -> TAX item net -8 (add-back sign).",
  "Kensho retention related expense categorised ACQ; lease impairments IMPAIR.",
  "Adjusted Corporate Unallocated Expense excluding adjusted Kensho expense ($11m): $29m (Exhibit 8).",
  "Indices operating profit attributable to the Company $98m; adjusted OP attributable (Adjusted Net Operating Profit) $100m (NCI $36m).",
  "Prior-year (Q3-17) columns restated for ASU 2017-07 (pension).",
  "Nine-month YTD (same release): adj NI 1,594, adj EPS 6.28.",
  "Intersegment royalty charged by Ratings to Market Intelligence: $28m.",
  "cfpub capex and nci_dist recorded as positive cash costs (release prints them in brackets). fcf_items signed as printed (added to FCF to reach FCF excluding certain items).",
  "rev_type key ELIM = intersegment elimination; CORP = Corporate revenue.",
  "py_seg = Q3-17 comparative on the 2018 basis: total OP 649 vs 658 as reported (pension reclass); unallocated 52 vs 45; adjusted OP 692 vs 701."
